---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Knight Capital, 1 August 2012: one order stream, eight SMARS servers, one of them still on the old code.
// Facts (8 servers, 7 updated, 212 orders, 4 million+ executions, 154 stocks, ~45 minutes, $460 million)
// are from the SEC order in the post's sources. Plain inline SVG with site tokens; no ids.

const W = 900;
const H = 330;
const sx0 = 262;
const sw = 70;
const sg = 10;
const sy = 92;
const sh = 74;
const servers = Array.from({ length: 8 }, (_, i) => ({ x: sx0 + i * (sw + sg), old: i === 7, n: i + 1 }));
const groupMid = (a: number, b: number) => (servers[a].x + servers[b].x + sw) / 2;
---
<figure class="kf">
  <div class="kf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Knight Capital's order router on 1 August 2012. Orders with the repurposed flag set are spread over eight SMARS servers. Seven servers run the new code and read the flag as the new retail program. The eighth server never received the new code, so it reads the same flag as Power Peg, the old feature. The 212 orders that landed on it became more than 4 million executions in 154 stocks in about 45 minutes, a loss of 460 million dollars.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="kf-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One flag, two meanings, eight servers</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một cờ, hai nghĩa, tám server</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="92" width="170" height="74" rx="5" class="kf-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="receipt" x={42} y={110} size={24} />
    <text x="108" y="122" text-anchor="middle" class="kf-title">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Orders</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lệnh</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="105" y="145" text-anchor="middle" class="kf-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>flag set (new meaning)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>cờ bật (nghĩa mới)</tspan>
    </text>

    <path d={`M190,129 L${sx0 - 12},129`} class="kf-arrow" />
    <polygon points={`${sx0 - 13},124 ${sx0 - 13},134 ${sx0 - 3},129`} class="kf-head" />

    {servers.map((s) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={s.x} y={sy} width={sw} height={sh} rx="5" class={s.old ? 'kf-box is-old' : 'kf-box'} />
        <DiagramIcon name="server" x={s.x + 17} y={sy + 25} size={22} />
        <text x={s.x + 44} y={sy + 30} text-anchor="start" class="kf-title">{`S${s.n}`}</text>
        <text x={s.x + sw / 2} y={sy + 54} text-anchor="middle" class={s.old ? 'kf-small is-old' : 'kf-small'}>
          <tspan data-lang-en>{s.old ? 'old code' : 'new code'}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{s.old ? 'code cũ' : 'code mới'}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}

    <path d={`M${servers[0].x},${sy + sh + 12} L${servers[0].x},${sy + sh + 18} L${servers[6].x + sw},${sy + sh + 18} L${servers[6].x + sw},${sy + sh + 12}`} class="kf-brace" />
    <text x={groupMid(0, 6)} y={sy + sh + 40} text-anchor="middle" class="kf-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>S1-S7 read it as the new program.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>S1-S7 đọc cờ là chương trình mới.</tspan>
    </text>

    <path d={`M${servers[7].x},${sy + sh + 12} L${servers[7].x},${sy + sh + 18} L${servers[7].x + sw},${sy + sh + 18} L${servers[7].x + sw},${sy + sh + 12}`} class="kf-brace is-old" />
    <text x={servers[7].x + sw} y={sy + sh + 40} text-anchor="end" class="kf-small is-old">
      <tspan data-lang-en>S8 reads it as Power Peg.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>S8 đọc cờ là Power Peg.</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="248" width="860" height="60" rx="5" class="kf-result" />
    <text x="36" y="274" class="kf-title">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Outcome: 212 orders on S8 became 4 million+ executions in 154 stocks, in about 45 minutes.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Kết quả: 212 lệnh rơi vào S8 thành hơn 4 triệu lần khớp, trên 154 mã, trong khoảng 45 phút.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="296" class="kf-small is-old">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Loss: $460 million. Rolling back the seven good servers made it worse: they read the flag the old way too.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thiệt hại: 460 triệu đô. Gỡ code mới khỏi 7 server đang đúng còn tệ hơn: giờ chúng cũng đọc cờ theo nghĩa cũ.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The incident as described in the SEC's 2013 order against Knight Capital. The server layout is simplified: the order is one stream, drawn as a single arrow.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Sự cố theo mô tả trong quyết định năm 2013 của SEC về Knight Capital. Sơ đồ server đã được đơn giản hoá: luồng lệnh được vẽ thành một mũi tên.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .kf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .kf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .kf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .kf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .kf .kf-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .kf .kf-title { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .kf .kf-small { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .kf .kf-small.is-old { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .kf-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .kf-box.is-old { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .kf-result { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .kf-arrow, .kf-brace { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .kf-brace.is-old { stroke: var(--red); }
  .kf-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .kf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
